    "detailed_description": "Planetstar Warrior is a 2D horizontal side-scrolling space shooter game that puts you up against a invading <br />\r\nenemy force trying to take over the galaxy!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nStory <br />\r\nThe galaxy is under threat by a mysterious alien force its up to you to stop the onslaught, Equip yourself with <br />\r\nmultiple power ups and fight through the increasing enemy waves, Can you reach the mothership and put a stop <br />\r\nto the invasion once and for all?<br />\r\n<br />\r\nKey Features<br />\r\nCollect power ups to destroy invading alien spaceships.<br />\r\nBattle through 15 levels of space with increasing difficulty.<br />\r\nDestroy the mothership to save the galaxy.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nTips<br />\r\nKeep moving to avoid enemy fire!<br />\r\nBe sure to grab shields power ups!<br />\r\nWait for the right moment to use your special!",
